        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the gaze of a silent, unknowable presence, a lone man climbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mountain. A burden. An endless ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No voice calls from the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No promise waits above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the weight you refuse to abandon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist symbolic experience, you guide a solitary wanderer as he pushes a massive rock endlessly uphill beneath the watch of something ancient and mysterious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple: press a single button to push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859520/extras/3241af4370a293f40c5c9ec69f5c806c.poster.avif?t=1780678004\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859520/extras/3241af4370a293f40c5c9ec69f5c806c.webm?t=1780678004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859520/extras/3241af4370a293f40c5c9ec69f5c806c.mp4?t=1780678004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– One-button gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Minimalist symbolic art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Atmospheric and meditative experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Endless ascent with no final destination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climb never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe that was never the point.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the gaze of a silent, unknowable presence, a lone man climbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mountain. A burden. An endless ascent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No voice calls from the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No promise waits above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the weight you refuse to abandon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this minimalist symbolic experience, you guide a solitary wanderer as he pushes a massive rock endlessly uphill beneath the watch of something ancient and mysterious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple: press a single button to push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859520/extras/3241af4370a293f40c5c9ec69f5c806c.poster.avif?t=1780678004\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859520/extras/3241af4370a293f40c5c9ec69f5c806c.webm?t=1780678004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859520/extras/3241af4370a293f40c5c9ec69f5c806c.mp4?t=1780678004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– One-button gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Minimalist symbolic art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Atmospheric and meditative experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Endless ascent with no final destination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climb never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe that was never the point.</p>",
